OL,3,GNEWSATwo hospitals declare critical
OL,4,Aincident has finished
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo hospitals have stood down a
OL,7,Fcritical incident declared earlier this
OL,8,Fweek.
OL,10,FOn Wednesday, University Hospitals of
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire said sustained
OL,12,Fpressure meant patients at Kettering
OL,13,Fand Northampton general hospitals would
OL,14,Fface longer waits for non-urgent
OL,15,Ftreatment and beds.
OL,17,FIn an update on Friday, the trust said
OL,18,Fsignificant efforts by staff had
OL,19,Fimproved the flow of patients through
OL,20,Fthe hospitals.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
