OL,3,GNEWSATwo hospitals declare critical
OL,4,Aincident has finished
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedical director Hemant Nemade said:
OL,7,F"We would like to thank all of our
OL,8,Fpatients for bearing with us at this
OL,9,Fdifficult time and all of the families
OL,10,Fwho supported us with discharging their
OL,11,Frelatives back into community
OL,12,Fsettings."
